OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FElizabeth Alker showcases the best
OL,12,     Fperformances from the UK and
OL,13,     Fbeyond, including a concert live
OL,14,     Ffrom Wigmore Hall and Brahms'
OL,15,     FViolin Concerto.
OL,16,G1600 Composer of the Week: Leonard
OL,17,G     Bernstein
OL,18,     F1/5. Donald Macleod explores
OL,19,     FBernstein's early years, and the
OL,20,     Finfluential contacts he made while
OL,21,     Fat Harvard who gave him a head
OL,22,     Fstart in his career.
